    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/11e61df08f51e004cc50a34efd7931e9.poster.avif?t=1754260950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/11e61df08f51e004cc50a34efd7931e9.webm?t=1754260950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/11e61df08f51e004cc50a34efd7931e9.mp4?t=1754260950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Splat off the walls, bowl thru stacks of barrels, and skate across puddles as an elastic, ever-morphing blob.<br></li><li>Drive a Forklift and other machinery to push, lift, and stack heavy obstacles to suit your oily needs.<br></li><li>Collect and launch more oil as you go, to grow into a formidable glob or shrink to a modest slick.<br></li><li>Explore an intricate open world and maybe uncover a nefarious plot?<br></li><li>Try On different hats to unlock a variety of short-term power-ups.<br></li><li>Slow time to pull a tricky maneuver, or just to savor your character\u2019s outlandish acrobatics.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/11e61df08f51e004cc50a34efd7931e9.poster.avif?t=1754260950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/11e61df08f51e004cc50a34efd7931e9.webm?t=1754260950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/11e61df08f51e004cc50a34efd7931e9.mp4?t=1754260950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Splat off the walls, bowl thru stacks of barrels, and skate across puddles as an elastic, ever-morphing blob.<br></li><li>Drive a Forklift and other machinery to push, lift, and stack heavy obstacles to suit your oily needs.<br></li><li>Collect and launch more oil as you go, to grow into a formidable glob or shrink to a modest slick.<br></li><li>Explore an intricate open world and maybe uncover a nefarious plot?<br></li><li>Try On different hats to unlock a variety of short-term power-ups.<br></li><li>Slow time to pull a tricky maneuver, or just to savor your character\u2019s outlandish acrobatics.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A 3D adventure starring a loose puddle of petroleum. Slip-n-slide your way through a compact open world as a morphing blob, governed by a custom fluid particle simulation. Collect more oil to grow big and juicy. Operate heavy machinery. Flush polluters down the drain.",
